  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MA-SME DEVELOPMENT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE DEVELOPMENT OBJECTIVE IS TO ENHANCE THE ABILITY OF MOROCCAN FIRMS TO PRODUCE AND COMPETE EFFECTIVELY IN WORLD MARKETS.  EXPECTED OUTCOME S ARE: A) ENSURING THAT PRIVATE EXPORTERS HAVE ACCESS TO TRADE AND INVESTMENT FINANCE; B) LOWERING TRANSACTION COSTS FOR EXPORTERS; AND C) HELPING EXPORTERS TO GAIN ACCESS TO WORLD MARKETS. 11/6/01.  Both CMU and SMU have agreed to drop the operation.  Government has decided to postpone this operation to a future date.</narrative>
  </description>
